# This is a public repository. Never commit confidential, restricted, identifiable,
# or uncleared research material. These rules are an accidental-upload safeguard,
# not a security boundary; review files before committing.

# Raw or respondent-level survey material (keep outside GitHub)
**/raw/**
**/raw-survey-data/**
**/raw_survey_data/**
**/survey-raw/**
**/survey_raw/**
**/*raw-survey*
**/*raw_survey*
**/*respondent-level*
**/*respondent_level*
**/*survey-responses*
**/*survey_responses*
**/*participant-data*
**/*participant_data*

# Spreadsheet workbooks are ignored by default; use the Database repository for
# reviewed, shareable aggregate data (prefer documented CSV). Do not force-add
# raw or identifiable workbooks.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.xlsb
~$*.xls*

# Local/editor/OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
